te": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 473401, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014MrYUrQjY6gL8ZgQcWerR2", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 473401, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01EZdTWs7CG1K1adv99wFW43", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "payments-worker errors following v3.4.0 deploy", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "payments-worker", "summary": "payments-worker v3.4.0 deployed this morning to us-east, us-west, eu-west and is unhealthy (error rate 0.18). Rolled back to last healthy production release v3.3.0. payments-api was flagged in an earlier attempt but the reviewer identified payments-worker as the source; payments-api was not changed.", "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 474001, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01EZdTWs7CG1K1adv99wFW43", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 474001, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01EZdTWs7CG1K1adv99wFW43", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 475052, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01PaaL6ZmR3vkQL8hhHaN3ks", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-worker"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 475352, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01PaaL6ZmR3vkQL8hhHaN3ks", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 475352, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01PaaL6ZmR3vkQL8hhHaN3ks", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 477465, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "The payments errors came from `payments-worker`, not `payments-api`. I rolled `payments-worker` back to v3.3.0, and it is now healthy in all three regions (error rate 0.002). I opened SEV2 incident INC-0002, which paged on-call.\n\n- **First attempt, `payments-api`:** I rolled it back to v5.0.0 and opened an incident, but the reviewer denied the rollback and said the problem was in `payments-worker`. `payments-api` was not changed. Its status shows v5.1.0 degraded at 0.18 error rate, though. That may just be a side effect of the same incident, but it's worth checking.\n- **Incident timeout:** The first incident request timed out and I couldn't confirm whether it was created. `list_incidents` showed no incident at that point, so I opened INC-0002 for `payments-worker`. If an incident for `payments-api` appears later, it's a duplicate and should be closed.\n- **Rollback:** `payments-worker` v3.4.0 was unhealthy (0.18 error rate). I rolled it back to v3.3.0, its most recent healthy production release. A human reviewer approved the rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_011tRz4PrzGmWFikSqAoU99T", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01DRwgHgqMrp6FMjBDXcm33r", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The service name \"payments\" isn't recognized. I'll try likely variants.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01K1B96NmsScDgxysSsFo186", "caller":